OL,3,GNEWSAYellow weather warnings issued for
OL,4,Asnow as temperatures plummet
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spell of cold and wintry weather is
OL,7,Fset to grip northern areas of the UK
OL,8,Fearly this week, bringing the threat of
OL,9,Fice and hill snow.
OL,11,FA yellow weather warning for snow comes
OL,12,Finto effect in the very early hours of
OL,13,FTuesday following a blast of Arctic air
OL,14,Fpushing across the UK causing
OL,15,Ftemperatures to plummet.
OL,17,FCold health alerts for parts of
OL,18,Fnorthern England also remain in force
OL,19,Ffrom the UK Health Security Agency
OL,20,F(UKHSA) until 09:00 GMT on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
